---
import { Terminal } from '@lucide/astro';
import GithubIcon from './GithubIcon.astro';
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-zinc-850 bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400 text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
      <!-- Col 1: About -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs border border-amber-500/30">
            ₿
          </div>
          <span class="font-extrabold text-sm tracking-tight text-white">
            kryptotipy<span class="text-amber-400">.sk</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Moderný, bleskovo rýchly krypto dashboard bez informačného smogu. Algoritmické skratky pre racionálne rozhodnutia na základe historických dát, pákového sentimentu a lokálnej legislatívy v SR a ČR.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            100% Client-Side Privacy
          </span>
          <span class="text-zinc-700">•</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400">GitHub Pages Jamstack</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Tech Specs (for Recruiters & Devs) -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <Terminal class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400" />
          <span>Tech Stack</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-mono">
          <li>• Astro (Static Site Generation)</li>
          <li>• Tailwind CSS (Bento Grid)</li>
          <li>• TypeScript (Strict Mode)</li>
          <li>• Vanilla TS Islands (Zero Framework Bloat)</li>
          <li>• GitHub Actions Hourly Cron</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Navigation -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200">
          Nástroje & Sekcie
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400">
          <li><a href="#semafor" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Semafor Trhu & Pákový Kompas</a></li>
          <li><a href="#polymarket" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Polymarket Smart Money</a></li>
          <li><a href="#zlavomat" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">ATH Zľavomat & Záchranné DCA</a></li>
          <li><a href="#stroj-casu" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Stroj Času (Krypto vs S&P 500)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#dane" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">SK vs CZ Daňový & Časový Test</a></li>
          <li><a href="#spravy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Lokálny RSS Prehľad</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
      <p class="text-center sm:text-left">
        <strong>Upozornenie:</strong> Tento portál slúži výhradne na vzdelávacie a analytické účely. Nejde o finančné, investičné ani záväzné daňové poradenstvo. Investovanie do kryptomien nesie riziko straty kapitálu.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/peterszatmary/kryptotipy.sk"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          <GithubIcon class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          <span>GitHub Repo</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
